{"id":"n62877-3-7","stage":4,"title":"서리다 · 郁结","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62877-3-7-1","ko":"아직도 헤어진 첫사랑이 생각나세요?","zh":"您还想着那段分手的初恋吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어진","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어진","audio":"/audio/5211997f96a84253c302.mp3"}},{"text":"첫사랑이","meaning":"初恋","explanation":"첫사랑：初恋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"첫사랑","audio":"/audio/48a5a8b2aea4dfccaf88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77839","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫사랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"첫사랑이","audio":"/audio/ac2ada819eb7c8de443d.mp3"}},{"text":"생각나세요?","meaning":"想念，思念","explanation":"생각나다：想念，思念；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"생각나다","audio":"/audio/26998f80f524d39a07ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62323","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각나세요","audio":"/audio/8684dd736ffb1a25b4ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"48a5a8b2aea4dfcc","term":"첫사랑","zh":"初恋","audio":"/audio/48a5a8b2aea4dfccaf88.mp3",